tax and reload\nsudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx\n'\nTask logs are available at: file:///home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/tasks/task-385.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/logs/chunks/transcript/00000004.jsonl:77:{"step_index":400,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T12:28:45Z","content":"I have audited, corrected, and verified the Nginx configuration on the Reverse Proxy (**`th2-revproxyp-fe1`** — `172.30.198.33`).\n\n---\n\n### What Was Checked & Corrected\n\n1. **Port 443 (Centreon Web)**:\n   * Restored and verified the main proxy to Centreon Web (`http://172.30.198.49`).\n   * Cleanly redirects root `/` to `/centreon/`.\n   * Preserves LoRaWAN `/lorawan/data` ingest on port `8443`.\n\n2. **Port 9443 (Centreon Map)**:\n   * Configured to listen on both **`172.30.198.33:9443`** and **`109.62.64.18:9443`**.\n   * Accepts both `map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr` and `extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`.\n   * Explicitly redirects `/` to `/centreon-map/` keeping the `:9443` port.\n   * Securely reverse-proxies to **`https://172.30.198.50:9443`** with SSL verification bypass and proper header forwarding.\n\n---\n\n### Live Validation Results on the Reverse Proxy\n\n```bash\n# 1. Port 443 (Centreon Web):\ncurl https://extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/\n--> HTTP/2 301 Moved Permanently (Location: https://extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/centreon/)\n\n# 2. Port 9443 on 172.30.198.33 (Internal IP):\ncurl https://172.30.198.33:9443/centreon-map/\n--> HTTP/2 401 Unauthorized (Direct from Centreon Map)\n\n# 3. Port 9443 on 109.62.64.18 (VIP Alias):\ncurl https://109.62.64.18:9443/centreon-map/\n--> HTTP/2 401 Unauthorized (Direct from Centreon Map)\n```\n\nBoth virtual hosts on `th2-revproxyp-fe1` are operating cleanly."}
