/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/logs/chunks/transcript/00000003.jsonl:46:{"step_index":270,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T09:01:42Z","content":"Here are the live logs from **`th2-revproxyp-fe1`** demonstrating that the redirection and reverse proxy to Centreon Map are working:\n\n---\n\n### 1. HTTP Transaction Trace\n\nA client requesting root `/` on port `9443` receives the <span style=\"color:yellow\">**HTTP 301**</span> redirect, and following it leads straight to the Centreon Map backend which responds with <span style=\"color:green\">**HTTP 401**</span>:\n\n```http\n# Step 1: Initial request to root /\nGET https://map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443/\nHTTP/2 301 \nlocation: https://map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443/centreon-map/\nserver: nginx\n\n# Step 2: Redirect followed to /centreon-map/ -> Proxied to 172.30.198.50:9443\nGET https://map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr:9443/centreon-map/\nHTTP/2 401 \nserver: nginx\ncontent-type: application/json;charset=ISO-8859-1\n{\"code\":401,\"message\":\"Full authentication is required to access this resource\"}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Live Access Log (`/var/log/nginx/extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-9443-access.log`)\n\n```text\n[10/Sep/2026:09:00:24 +0000] \"GET / HTTP/2.0\" 301 162 \"-\" \"curl/7.74.0\"\n[10/Sep/2026:09:00:24 +0000] \"GET /centreon-map/ HTTP/2.0\" 401 80 \"-\" \"curl/7.74.0\"\n```\n\n### Log Breakdown:\n* **Line 1 (`301`)**: Root `/` hits Nginx $\\rightarrow$ Nginx evaluates `location = /` $\\rightarrow$ issues a <span style=\"color:yellow\">**301 Moved Permanently**</span> to `/centreon-map/` keeping the `:9443` port.\n* **Line 2 (`401`)**: The browser/client immediately requests `/centreon-map/` $\\rightarrow$ Nginx proxies to `https://172.30.198.50:9443` $\\rightarrow$ Centreon Map's Tomcat server responds with <span style=\"color:green\">**401 Unauthorized**</span> (requesting login credentials/token)."}
