he new subdomain until we expand the certificate).\n* We can then easily add the new subdomain to the Certbot certificate using DNS-01 via your automated playbook.\n\n**Please share the exact FQDN you created, and I will back up and update the Nginx configuration on `172.30.198.33` immediately.**","thinking":"**Investigating Timeout, Confirming Hostname**\n\nThe connection timeout suggests a network issue. Internal workstations might have firewalls blocking external access, or the firewall rules could be incomplete. However, the exact hostname is unknown. Clarifying the Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN) is necessary.\n\n\n"}
