/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/tasks/task-956.log:873:/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/tasks/task-956.log:386:/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/logs/chunks/transcript_full/00000011.jsonl:1:;\n\n    # security\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\n\n    # logging\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\n\n    # Redirection explicite racine -> /centreon-map/\n    location = / {\n        return 301 /centreon-map/;\n    }\n\n    # reverse proxy vers Map (Tomcat HTTPS sur port 9443)\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;\n        proxy_ssl_verify           off;\n\n        include                    nginxconfig.io/proxy.conf;\n        proxy_set_header Host      $http_host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Ssl   on;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Port  9443;\n\n        proxy_redirect             http:// https://;\n        proxy_headers_hash_max_size   1024;\n        proxy_headers_hash_bucket_size 128;\n    }\n\n    # additional config\n    include nginxconfig.io/general.conf;\n}\n","Description":"Update 03-map to bind explicitly to 172.30.198.33:9443 and 109.62.64.18:9443","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/scratch/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf","toolAction":"Updating scratch vhost","toolSummary":"Update scratch 03-map vhost"}}]}
/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/tasks/task-956.log:874:/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/tasks/task-956.log:387:/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/.system_generated/logs/chunks/transcript_full/00000011.jsonl:30:{"step_index":810,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T13:39:19Z","thinking":"**Confirming successful TLS setup**\n\nThe task completed successfully, indicated by the zero exit code. Further confirmation arrived via the passing of strict TLS verification. Absence of related errors suggests a correctly configured and trusted certificate, verifying the reverse proxy chain. Concluding that TLS setup is operational, the report artifact requires an update.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete final report for Centreon Map integration. Details the DNS-01 Let's Encrypt certificate issuance via passwordless SSH to th2-dnsp-mst1, the deployment of dedicated TLS certificates and independent Nginx vhost on th2-revproxyp-fe1, and end-to-end strict TLS validation from th2-centprop-be1.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Centreon Map Integration & Reverse Proxy Chain Report\n\n## 1. Executive Summary\n\nThe entire communication chain for **Centreon Map** (`172.30.198.50:9443`) through the Reverse Proxy **`th2-revproxyp-fe1`** (`172.30.198.33:9443`) and the Central Backend **`th2-centprop-be1`** (`172.30.198.49`) has been fully established, secured with a dedicated Let's Encrypt production certificate, and verified.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Key Actions Performed & Milestones\n\n### A. Passwordless DNS-01 Challenge via `th2-dnsp-mst1`\n1. **Direct Master Authentication**:\n   * Verified passwordless SSH access to the authoritative PowerDNS master **`th2-dnsp-mst1`** (`superuser@172.30.198.162:30`) using your ED25519 SSH key (`~/.ssh/id_ed25519`).\n   * Confirmed passwordless sudo rights for `pdnsutil`. No HTTP REST API or external API keys were needed.\n2. **Dynamic Record Management**:\n   * Updated the Certbot DNS-01 authentication hook ([`pdns-auth-hook.sh`](file:///home/koby/.ansible/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/pdns-auth-hook.sh)) and cleanup hook ([`pdns-cleanup-hook.sh`](file:///home/koby/.ansible/playbooks/files/certbot-hooks/pdns-cleanup-hook.sh)).\n   * Challenges are directly injected into zone `outremer-telecom.fr` via `pdnsutil replace-rrset` and `pdnsutil increase-serial`.\n   * Propagation was verified against public resolvers (Google DoH and Cloudflare DoH) before returning to Certbot.\n3. **Production Certificate Issued**:\n   * **Domain**: `map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`\n   * **Issuer**: `Let's Encrypt (CN = YE2)`\n   * **Validity**: September 10, 2026 to December 9, 2026\n   * **SAN**: `DNS:map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`\n\n---\n\n### B. Dedicated Certificate & Nginx Vhost on `th2-revproxyp-fe1`\n\nAs requested, rather than coupling the configuration into the existing file, a **dedicated, independent architecture** was deployed on the reverse proxy:\n\n1. **Certificate Deployment**:\n   * Saved into [`/etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/`](file:///etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/) (`fullchain.pem`, `privkey.pem`, `cert.pem`, `chain.pem`) with strict permissions (`0644` / `0600`).\n2. **Dedicated Vhost Created**:\n   * File: [`/etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf)\n   * Enabled via symlink in [`/etc/nginx/sites-enabled/`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-enabled/).\n   * Listens explicitly on `172.30.198.33:9443` (internal DMZ) and `109.62.64.18:9443` (public VIP).\n   * Points to upstream `https://172.30.198.50:9443` with `proxy_ssl_verify off;`.\n   * Dedicated access and error logs:\n     * `/var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log`\n     * `/var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log`\n   * Automatic redirect `/` $\\rightarrow$ `/centreon-map/`.\n   * Preserved headers: `Host $http_host;`, `X-Forwarded-Proto https;`, `X-Forwarded-Port 9443;`.\n   * Cleaned up [`/etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf`](file:///etc/nginx/sites-available/02-extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf) to remove all port `9443` blocks.\n3. **Nginx Reload**:\n   * `nginx -t`: **Syntax OK, test successful**.\n   * Reloaded without downtime.\n\n---\n\n## 3. End-to-End Verification Results\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    Central[\"th2-centprop-be1\\n(172.30.198.49)\\nCentreon Central PHP\"] -->|\"HTTPS :9443\\n(Strict TLS Verified)\"| RevProxy[\"th2-revproxyp-fe1\\n(172.30.198.33)\\nNginx Proxy\"]\n    ExtUser[\"External Browser\\n(map.extranetclient...)\"] -->|\"HTTPS :9443\\n(Valid Public Cert)\"| RevProxy\n    RevProxy -->|\"HTTPS :9443 (TLS)\\nproxy_ssl_verify off\"| Map[\"th2-centprop-map\\n(172.30.198.50)\\nTomcat Engine\"]\n```\n\n| Source / Target | Test Command | Result | Status |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |\n| **Local Machine $\\rightarrow$ Port 9443** | `openssl s_client -connect 172.30.198.33:9443` | `CN=map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`, Issuer `Let's Encrypt (YE2)` | **VERIFIED** |\n| **Local Machine $\\rightarrow$ Port 9443** | `curl -sS -I https://map.extranetclient...:9443/` | `HTTP/2 301` $\\rightarrow$ `location: .../centreon-map/` (Strict TLS OK, no `-k`) | **VERIFIED** |\n| **Central Backend (`.49`) $\\rightarrow$ Reverse Proxy** | `curl -sS -I https://map.extranetclient...:9443/` | `HTTP/2 301` (Strict TLS OK, no `-k`, `/etc/hosts` routing OK) | **VERIFIED** |\n| **Central Backend (`.49`) $\\rightarrow$ Centreon Map** | `curl -sS -I https://map.extranetclient...:9443/centreon-map/` | `HTTP/2 400/401` (Centreon Map application response reached) | **VERIFIED** |\n\n---\n\n## 4. Final Verification in the Centreon Web UI\n\nYou can now return to the Centreon Web Interface:\n1. Navigate to: **`Administration > Extensions > Options`**.\n2. Under the Map server settings, click **\"Test connection to server\"**.\n3. Because the certificate is now natively trusted by PHP cURL with an exact SAN match for `map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr`, the test will succeed with a green status.\n","Description":"Update Centreon Map report artifact with completion of DNS-01 issuance, dedicated vhost deployment, and end-to-end strict TLS verification.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/home/koby/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/centreon-map-chain-report.md","toolAction":"Updating report artifact","toolSummary":"Finalize Centreon Map report"}}]}
